<https://w3id.org/iaos/resource/affiliation/https-openalex-org-a5000369565__https-op-1e79a783f7> <https://w3id.org/iaos/ontology#startDate> "2009-01-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
